Subject: [PATCH] node: publish mountInfo.json by atomic rename

---
 pkg/driver/metadata_atomic.go      | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 pkg/driver/metadata_atomic_test.go | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++
 pkg/driver/nodeserver.go           |  5 +---
 3 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 pkg/driver/metadata_atomic.go
